,"text":"L何だろー？だれか、ぐぐってー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LIZLISAとLISLISAどっちが正しいの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"L　LIZLISAです＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんてどんな女の子？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LTHEあいどる*。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"納豆が好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Lめっちゃ好きーω"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎しっぽく料理☆って　知っとる？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"L知ってます＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなブランドって何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LLIZLISA onespo"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1930577/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、MILKは道重さんの影響で可愛いと思った"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1930577/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"年上だけど、応援してもいいカナ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"L全然おっけーです（。・・。）年齢とか関係なしです！応援してくれるだけでうれしい*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番好きなアニメを教えて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Lけいおん！夏目友人帳　おじゃ魔女どれみちゃん　セーラームーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今期は、特にAKB0048　君と僕。　ハヤテのごとく!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。ごめんなさい（；；）一番が決めれなくて；；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルも好きとよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"L大好き＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ももクロは好きと？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"L最近はまりすぎて、ずっとももクロさんの動画を見てる＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなアイドルの推しメンば教えて（^０^）／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LAKBさんだと渡辺麻友さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他、いろいろ＞＜　ハロプロさんは、道重さんとか愛理さんとかとか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなの好きな私服タイプは何ですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"L"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に決まってないなあ!今、どうしようか悩み中...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"流行を少し取り入れた個性的なのが好きかな＾＾"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしたら、イイ先輩になれますか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"L周りのことを考えれる先輩とかひなは、なりたいです＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな漫画は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Lフクシマハルカ先生とか、ワンピースとかぴゅ−っと吹くジャガー、ガンダムきのこ味とか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなたんの好きなキャラクターは何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Lまいめろちゃん＊さゆうさ＊ダッフィー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"猿と目を合わせたことある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Lない！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1930577/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画描いたりもするんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"L一時期はまって、ネットでやり方みて研究してた笑。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一応、原画用紙とかインク、専用のペンとかいろいろ持ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵が上手いかは（ｒｙ←←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おわりーーー＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問答えてないのがあったら、ごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1930577/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回からは、質問募集っていうのをたまにするので、またその時に質問あったらしてね（・U・）♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの心に魔法をかけちゃうぞ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1930577/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1930577/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃーばいぴょーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1930577/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/13/1930577/0000.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}